    "cues": [
      {
        "id": "product-01",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 8,
        "lines": [
          "Two agents can share the same information.",
          "But does that mean they have the same authority?"
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            491.0,
            922,
            1429.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            430.5,
            978,
            1489.5,
            1021
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 59
      },
      {
        "id": "product-02",
        "start": 8,
        "end": 16,
        "lines": [
          "When different people delegate authority, the agents",
          "need to know whose approval a decision requires."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            397.5,
            922,
            1522.5,
            966
          ],
          [
            433.0,
            978,
            1487.0,
            1021
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 59
      },
      {
        "id": "product-03",
        "start": 16,
        "end": 25.75,
        "lines": [
          "Culture-Fit is an open-source Human-in-the-Loop layer. It connects",
          "evidence, delegated authority, and human judgment when a decision needs it."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            245.0,
            922,
            1675.0,
            965
          ],
          [
            137.0,
            978,
            1783.0,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-04",
        "start": 25.75,
        "end": 33,
        "lines": [
          "Try it in your browser, or download the source and run it in your own environment."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            95.0,
            974,
            1825.0,
            1018
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "product-05",
        "start": 33,
        "end": 42,
        "lines": [
          "Download and extract the source ZIP. Use uv to prepare the Python environment."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            106.5,
            974,
            1813.5,
            1017
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 63
      },
      {
        "id": "product-06",
        "start": 42,
        "end": 51,
        "lines": [
          "Choose your operating system in the setup guide. On Mac, use",
          "the shell script. On Windows, use the PowerShell command."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            300.5,
            922,
            1619.5,
            966
          ],
          [
            326.5,
            978,
            1593.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-07",
        "start": 51,
        "end": 59,
        "lines": [
          "If you use OpenClaw, download the Skill ZIP and",
          "configure it to connect to your running Culture-Fit server."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            454.5,
            922,
            1465.5,
            966
          ],
          [
            351.5,
            978,
            1568.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-08",
        "start": 59,
        "end": 67,
        "lines": [
          "The interface is in English.",
          "Conversation analysis supports both English and Korean."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            681.0,
            922,
            1239.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            357.5,
            978,
            1562.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-09",
        "start": 67,
        "end": 75,
        "lines": [
          "From the workspace, import a conversation or",
          "explore a prepared example that needs a decision."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            475.0,
            922,
            1445.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            429.0,
            978,
            1491.0,
            1021
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 59
      },
      {
        "id": "product-10",
        "start": 75,
        "end": 84,
        "lines": [
          "Here, Release Agent and Review Agent both",
          "have approval grants for the same release."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            494.0,
            922,
            1426.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            509.5,
            979,
            1410.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-11",
        "start": 84,
        "end": 92,
        "lines": [
          "Their grants come from different owners. The decision owner is still unknown."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            134.5,
            974,
            1785.5,
            1018
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "product-12",
        "start": 92,
        "end": 101,
        "lines": [
          "The decision brief brings together agreements, open",
          "questions, and points that need human judgment."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            403.0,
            922,
            1517.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            436.5,
            978,
            1483.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-13",
        "start": 101,
        "end": 109,
        "lines": [
          "Select a source reference to read the original",
          "message, and check what was actually said."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            484.0,
            922,
            1436.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            494.0,
            978,
            1426.0,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-14",
        "start": 109,
        "end": 117,
        "lines": [
          "Now, put Review Agent first in the proposed priority order."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            343.5,
            974,
            1576.5,
            1018
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "product-15",
        "start": 117,
        "end": 125,
        "lines": [
          "With only one owner’s approval recorded,",
          "the other owner’s approval is still required."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            519.5,
            922,
            1400.5,
            966
          ],
          [
            507.0,
            978,
            1413.0,
            1021
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 59
      },
      {
        "id": "product-16",
        "start": 125,
        "end": 133,
        "lines": [
          "Record both owners’ agreement, then save the priority order for this decision."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            139.5,
            974,
            1780.5,
            1018
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "product-17",
        "start": 133,
        "end": 142,
        "lines": [
          "After the authority check updates, Review Agent appears as the decision owner.",
          "It is clear who can proceed."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            110.0,
            922,
            1810.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            672.0,
            978,
            1248.0,
            1021
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 59
      },
      {
        "id": "product-18",
        "start": 142,
        "end": 151,
        "lines": [
          "This decision applies to approval of this release.",
          "Other actions are checked against their own scope and authority."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            452.5,
            922,
            1467.5,
            965
          ],
          [
            270.5,
            978,
            1649.5,
            1022
          ]
        ],
        "bottom_margin": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "product-19",
        "start": 151,
        "end": 159.4,
        "lines": [
          "In your own installation, agents can use MCP to report",
          "conversations and query next actions and authority."
        ],
        "glyph_bounds": [
          [
            391.0,
            922,
            1529.0,
            966
          ],
          [
            409.5,
